[11.417312, "o", "\r\u001b[2K│  \u001b[33mtotal zoom: ×10³³. physics verified down to ~10⁻¹⁸ m; below that the map\r\n"]
[11.417408, "o", "│  \u001b[33mis theory, labeled as such — then the road ends, not with a thing, but with\r\n│  \u001b[33mthe end of the CONCEPT of size as current physics can define it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  two reference frames, both honest: the counter counts orders below\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  1 m (×10^35 lands on the 10^-35 m wall); from the 10^-2 m keycap that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  asked the question, the trip itself is ×10^33.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.417431, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L21 · THE EDGE — here be dragons \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.417447, "o", "\u001b[2m│  the honest inventory of what 'deeper' cannot currently answer\u001b[0m\r\n│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.417459, "o", "│    \u001b[2mno verified theory. strings: 10 extra dims, unproven. LQG: quantized space, unproven.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.497611, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? vacuum catastrophe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.497702, "o", "│    \u001b[2mQFT predicts empty-space energy 10¹²⁰× observed — worst miss in physics. machine works anyway.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.575626, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? dark sector\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.575784, "o", "│    \u001b[2m~95% of the universe (dark energy ~68% + dark matter ~27%) unmeasured. we are the minority.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.651274, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? measurement problem\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.651381, "o", "│    \u001b[2mL19. unsolved since 1927 — the longest-running spiral in science.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.73147, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? holography / it-from-bit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.73159, "o", "│    \u001b[2mreal math (AdS/CFT): a volume fully encoded on its boundary. proven in toy universes only.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.80901, "o", "│  every previous level answered. this one refuses. the bottom of 'as deep as\r\n"]
[11.80917, "o", "│  we can' is a boundary of knowledge, drawn in 10⁻³⁵ m ink.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L22 · BELOW THE WALL — the map of the unverified \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  the last floor: not a place — a stack of hypotheses with no floor yet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.939291, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ string theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.939406, "o", "│    \u001b[2meverything = 1D filaments ~10⁻³⁵ m, modes = particles. needs 10 spatial dimensions. no unique experimental test to date. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.032031, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ loop quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.032169, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspace and time themselves quantized; smallest volume ~4×10⁻¹⁰⁵ m³. no confirmed prediction. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.125041, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ causal set theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.12516, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspacetime grows from a discrete partial order of events — 'before' is the only primitive. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.217772, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ the holographic principle\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.217866, "o", "│    \u001b[2m3D reality fully encoded on a 2D boundary. exact for some toy universes (AdS/CFT); ours: UNKNOWN.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.307979, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.308064, "o", "│  \u001b[1mthis is maximum depth. not because we stopped digging — because the\r\n│  shovel is made of the thing we're digging in.\u001b[0m below the wall there is no\r\n│  'below'. there are proposals, beautifully drawn, none with a floor of their own.\r\n│  \u001b[31mdeepest we can go = a well-posed map of what we cannot reach.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.308087, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  FINAL REPORT — THE COMPLETE DESCENT · L0 → L22 · MAXIMUM DEPTH REACHED\r\n"]
