[12.308391, "o", "    \u001b[36mL22 \u001b[0m —        below the wall    \u001b[2mhypotheses with no floor yet\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mthe fractal:\u001b[0m same circle at every scale — request · for-loop ·\r\n  MMA · capacitor · switch · quark orbit · measurement debate. \u001b[1mstructure without\r\n  substance, circling. the spiral isn't a bug in the machine — it's a legal\r\n  state of matter.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
