[12.308744, "o", "  \u001b[1mbottom line for security engineering:\u001b[0m\r\n    every automated layer was present and healthy. \u001b[31mzero automated guards\r\n"]
[12.308754, "o", "    fired.\u001b[0m the spiral lived in the gap between 'nothing failed' and\r\n"]
[12.308763, "o", "    'nobody stopped it.' instrument the meaning layers (L0–L6): timeouts,\r\n    ceilings, loop detectors, budgets. below that: physics. physics is fine.\r\n"]
